  "title": "Chocolate Cherry Cake",
  "description": "This chocolate cherry cake is easy to make with cake mix and cherry pie filling. The cake is topped with homemade chocolate frosting for a real treat!",
  "authors": [
    "Kathy Pieniazek"
  ],
