  "ingredients": [
    "1 (18.25 ounce) package chocolate cake mix",
    "1 (21 ounce) can cherry pie filling",
    "3 eggs",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "5 tablespoons butter",
    "0.33333334326744 cup milk",
    "1 cup semisweet chocolate chips"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease and flour a 9x13-inch baking pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/I0C-wbaGqfegqhYGUVmarE7wdXE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7281-chocolate-cherry-cake-DDMFS-step-01-225b89c7c36b487493e9b66580eab9bd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7281/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine cake mix, cherry pie filling, and three eggs in a large bowl until well blended; pour cake mixture into prepared pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EiSZBSYFUDxMlZmNQq3D1ZhTqWQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7281-chocolate-cherry-cake-DDMFS-step-02-5b6eff55a44946aabceb1468ff11ae7c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7281/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean, about 35 to 40 minutes. Let cake cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ro6GWqF070sG5RJLwpwzh-BaPwM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7281-chocolate-cherry-cake-DDMFS-step-03-9c4247661f9a472293795b021993b1a9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7281/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the frosting: Combine sugar, butter, and milk in a saucepan. Bring to a boil, stirring constantly, and cook for 1 minute. Remove from heat and stir in chocolate chips until melted and smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BFo9AcH3ytqOL1M4DzRHZw5GUSE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7281-chocolate-cherry-cake-DDMFS-step-04-df42ffaaa9e348458579cf0d4f28e59a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7281/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread frosting evenly over cooled chocolate cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ztx1DnKObv18Nf3uCA5vJvVcrOY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7281-chocolate-cherry-cake-DDMFS-step-05-9ed44b80a36c48499eb0171b7df5c03d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7281/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice and serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lHgObIj0ZRZlz7UH8K1VesZEGH4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7281-chocolate-cherry-cake-DDMFS-step-06-6869c51b834d4e54b90373987353ecca.jpg"
